Quality Throughout — Space, Style & Effortless Living
1 KENMARE STREET, WATSONIA • DATE PUBLISHED: 22 SEP 2026
EXPRESSIONS OF INTEREST CLOSING THURSDAY 15TH OCTOBER AT 3PM (UNLESS SOLD PRIOR)

Freshly built and thoughtfully designed, this impressive residence delivers the space and flexibility today's families are searching for, finished to an exceptional standard from top to bottom.

The ground floor centres around a large open-plan kitchen, meals and family zone — the natural heart of the home — featuring premium stone benchtops, Boston Oak cabinetry and a full suite of 900mm Bosch appliances including cooktop, oven and dishwasher. Soaring 3m ceilings add to the sense of space, flowing seamlessly out to a covered entertaining deck and grassed backyard, perfect for weekend gatherings or quiet evenings alike. A generous main bedroom with its own ensuite is also positioned downstairs, offering a private retreat away from the everyday hustle.

Upstairs, a striking American oak timber staircase leads to a second living zone, providing the perfect separation for family time, movie nights or a teenage retreat, alongside two further generous bedrooms and a versatile study or fourth bedroom — ideal for those working from home or needing extra flexibility.

Throughout the home, quality is evident in every detail — engineered hardwood timber flooring, floor-to-ceiling wall tiles in all wet areas, square-set ceilings, double glazed windows, premium brushed gold tapware and fixtures, and oversized 2340mm internal and external doors. Completing the package is a double garage with drive-through access, adding valuable convenience and storage.

Features you'll love:

* 900mm Bosch appliances — cooktop, oven & dishwasher
* Refrigerated ducted multi-head heating and cooling
* Engineered hardwood timber flooring
* Floor-to-ceiling wall tiles in wet areas
* American oak timber staircase
* Premium stone benchtops & Boston Oak cabinetry
* Double glazed windows throughout
* Premium brushed gold tapware and fixtures
* 3m ceilings to ground floor with square-set detailing
* Oversized 2340mm internal and external doors

A home built for growing families and effortless entertaining — inspect today to see the quality for yourself.


